reover, as far as I know, the Kimi 1.5 weights were never publicly shared.<=
/span></p><p>So, most likely the Kimi K2 team took these lessons to heart a=
nd shared Kimi K2 as an open-weight model, before DeepSeek R2 was released.=
 As of this writing, Kimi K2 is the most impressive open-weight model.</p><=
