rom 128k to 256k.</span></p><p><span>According to the </span><a href=3D"htt=
ps://moonshotai.github.io/Kimi-K2/thinking.html">benchmarks shared by the K=
imi team</a><span>, the model exceeds the performance of the leading propri=
etary LLMs. (Unfortunately, there is no direct comparison to DeepSeek R1.</=
