 3</a><span> 7B and 32B models on November 20. (The official spelling was c=
hanged from OLMo to Olmo, so I will be adopting that in this section.)</spa=
n></p><p><span>As mentioned earlier, Olmo models are always interesting bec=
ause they are fully open-source. Here, that means that the team also shares=
